  "abstract": "Install, run, tune and operate the Ollama local model server on macOS, Linux (NVIDIA, AMD ROCm, Vulkan, ARM64, Jetson), Windows and Docker. Covers the OLLAMA_* environment variables, systemd and Docker setups, Modelfiles, library and Hugging Face GGUF imports, context length, KV cache and flash attention, keep-alive, parallelism and multi-GPU scheduling, the native, OpenAI-compatible and Anthropic-compatible APIs, tool calling, thinking, structured outputs, vision, embeddings, cloud models, LAN exposure, updating and troubleshooting, with combos for Hugging Face GGUF, llama-swap and tunnels. Verified against Ollama v0.40.3.",
